  "goodToKnow": "Der Brei is porridge, mash or purée: der Kartoffelbrei (mashed potatoes, also Püree), der Milchreis, Babybrei. Two idioms: um den heißen Brei herumreden (to beat about the bush, literally to talk around the hot porridge) and Viele Köche verderben den Brei (too many cooks spoil the broth). Jemandem Brei ums Maul schmieren means to butter someone up. Plural: die Breie."
